  P('In many instances, ...','Birçok örnekte, ...','C1','resmî','In many instances, the data were incomplete.','Birçok örnekte veriler eksikti.',('Was ALL of the data incomplete?', '___ the data were incomplete.', ['There is no doubt that ...', 'Undoubtedly, ...'])),
